      "message": "fix(ui): give painted browser rows and menus AccessKit labels\n\nAdd AccessKit WidgetInfo labels to browser tree rows, eye toggles, and\ncontext-menu rows. Clamp the browser tree rect width to the visible clip\nedge so eye toggles stay hit-testable at their AccessKit centers. Drive\nall six browser behaviour tests by label instead of fixed coordinates,\nand remove BROWSER_TREE_TOP and BROWSER_EYE_X.\n\nFixes #1989",
